AUDIO: 'everything in post. Things that we did in [music] production just didn\'t edit together the way that I thought that they would. So, I was having to reorder scenes, create entirely new VFX shots, record [music] a bunch of ADR just to make sure that the story flowed. I'

[02:38] [scene:production]
VISUAL: A close-up of hands adjusting settings on an iPhone attached to a camera rig.
AUDIO: 'walked away from that experience thinking, there has to be a better way to make a movie. And I saw a YouTube video for [music] this app called Jetet, watched all the tutorials that I could. I downloaded it and started playing and practicing just'

[02:51] [scene:ui]
VISUAL: A split screen showing raw footage and a Blender UI with 3D models and node editor.
AUDIO: '[music] trying to see what this app could do. when I realized, oh, this is going to let me do VFX a lot more efficiently so that I could focus my time on [music] the creative part of the VFX work, which is all of like the worldbuilding decisions about what those'

